		"name": "Teacher Dashboard API",
		"description": "Full collection for the teacher-backend API using Node.js, TypeScript, and Supabase.\n\n**Usage**\n1. Start the backend (`npm run dev`) — default `http://localhost:3000`.\n2. Run **Auth > Create First Admin** (works only once).\n3. Run **Auth > Dashboard Login** with the same email/password. The token is auto-saved to the `{{token}}` collection variable.\n4. All protected requests use `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}` via collection-level auth.\n5. Resources auto-save their `id` to collection variables when created (`{{teacherId}}`, `{{subjectId}}`, `{{studentId}}`, `{{scheduleId}}`, `{{attendanceId}}`).",
